# firstbyte 核心算法与仿真仓库

## 环境要求
- Ubuntu 22.04
- ROS2 Humble
- Gazebo 11
- OpenCV 4.5+

## 编译与运行指南
1. 请先确保安装了必要的依赖：
   sudo apt install ros-humble-cv-bridge ros-humble-usb-cam ros-humble-gazebo-ros-pkgs libopencv-dev

2. 编译工作空间：
   cd ~/roboforge_ws
   colcon build --packages-select cv_pkg roboforge_simulation
   source install/setup.bash

3. 运行仿真与视觉（需开三个终端）：
   - 终端1: ros2 launch roboforge_simulation sim.launch.py
   - 终端2: ros2 run topic_tools relay /camera/image_raw /image_raw
   - 终端3: ros2 run cv_pkg vision_node
